<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>lose myself in you</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Abby Roberts, re6ce</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">lose myself in you</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6xuOyswMC7oj12UcGXrGXx</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.157" end="00:18.923">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.923" end="00:22.521">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.521" end="00:30.351">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.351" end="00:33.849">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.849" end="00:35.349" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.250" end="00:38.142">Lying on my bedroom floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.142" end="00:42.145">Been in my head for days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.145" end="00:47.311">I'm so sorry, using you is my escape</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.311" end="00:53.268">I'll drift away, I'll dissipate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.268" end="00:57.128">And leave my body going 'round in outer space</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.128" end="00:58.628" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.433" end="01:01.932">Sometimes I catch myself in a room full of people</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.932" end="01:05.016">They're all talking, I'm holding your hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.016" end="01:09.153">I'm crackin' silly little jokes in this accent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.153" end="01:13.032">I might joke, never felt so alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.032" end="01:16.283">I try, I crawl, I cry, okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.283" end="01:19.061">Didn't mean to leave you dazed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.061" end="01:20.561" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.549" end="01:27.488">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.488" end="01:31.096">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.096" end="01:38.944">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.944" end="01:42.830">Mysеlf in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.830" end="01:44.330" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.303" end="01:46.862">You know how I feel 'bout it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.862" end="01:49.599">On the tungsten, gеttin' wasted on it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.599" end="01:52.194">I'll be tongue-tied, feeling hopeless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.194" end="01:54.639">I can't express all my concerns</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.639" end="01:56.749">But I've been out back too long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.749" end="01:58.249">I can't do it again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.819" end="01:59.319" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.036" end="01:59.536">You said I'm way too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.512" end="02:01.012">Oh no, we're just friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.944" end="02:02.457">You know, it plays on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.457" end="02:03.957">Like, again and again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.748" end="02:06.472">And the cycle repeats, oh, can't we pretend?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.472" end="02:07.972" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.296" end="02:10.469">Tryna find myself in others' eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.469" end="02:16.499">I'm just making out a lie, out a lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.499" end="02:18.238" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.238" end="02:26.002">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.002" end="02:29.528">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.528" end="02:37.423">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.423" end="02:40.824">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.824" end="02:47.220" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.220" end="02:55.220">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.544" end="03:00.908">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.908" end="03:08.908">I lose myself in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.158" end="03:14.158">Myself in you, I feel so blue</p></div></body></tt>